  "worked_solution": "First,  notice that the given expression is a perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{4}\u2061x-2{csc}^{2}\u2061x\\,\\cdot \\,{cot}^{2}\u2061x+{cot}^{4}\u2061x & ={({csc}^{2}\u2061x-{cot}^{2}\u2061x)}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the  identity ${csc}^{2}\u2061x-{cot}^{2}\u2061x=1$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({csc}^{2}\u2061x-{cot}^{2}\u2061x)}^{2} & =(1)^{2} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
